<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λώτ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτός</span> III. I) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lotus</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.2.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.5.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.432.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.76
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>made of lotus-wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθυμίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολεόν, μέγα λ. ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					24.45
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. αὐλοί</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτός</span> III. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> a, b) <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.182d
			</span></i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀηδόνες</span>, of
			flutes, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				931
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>covered with lotus</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχθοι Ἀχέροντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					p.44
				</span></i>
			 Lobel. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>made of the flowers of Nymphaea Nelumbo</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτός</span> II), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					15.677d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
